flowchart LR
    S([Analyst opens Analyse traffic]) --> C{File chosen or<br/>sample selected?}
    C -- yes --> T{.csv and ≤ 5 MB?}
    T -- yes --> P[Parse header and rows]
    P --> R{Header present, rows consistent,<br/>≤ 5,000 rows?}
    R -- yes --> A[Send flows to /predict_raw]
    A --> K{All 67 required<br/>columns present?}
    K -- yes --> V[Coerce values, flag invalid rows]
    V --> X[Scale → predict → TreeSHAP]
    X --> D[(Store run and predictions)]
    D --> O[/Show KPIs and alerts with reasons/]
    O --> Z([End])
    C -- no --> E[/Show specific, plain-language error;<br/>keep the form so the user can retry/]
    T -- no --> E
    R -- no --> E
    K -- no --> E
    E --> Z2([End: user corrects file])
